@startuml
title L2-045 - Support keyboard and assistive technology
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}

actor "Owner / release reviewer" as actor
box "Frontend - Loupe application" #E0F2FE
participant "LibraryShell" as page
participant "LayoutProfile" as entity
end box
box "Frontend - Loupe components / api contracts" #E0F2FE
participant "View / interface-bound service or test harness" as client
end box
note over page, client : Local interaction; feature services use their documented API slices
actor -> page : Start workflow / review
page -> entity : Named control activation with logical focus [L2-045]
entity --> page : Focus management, field associations and live status
page -> client : Open/close modal or complete task
client --> page : Focus restored; no trap; accessible success/error
note over entity : Manual + automated A/AA evidence; contrast and >= 24 px targets
page --> actor : complete workflow without applicable A/AA issue
@enduml
